PHP 8.6 removed the INI_INT()/INI_STR()/INI_FLT() macros (replaced by
zend_ini_{long,string,double}_literal()) and the XtOffsetOf() alias of
offsetof() (UPGRADING.INTERNALS). This is upstream pull request
https://github.com/php-amqp/php-amqp/pull/638 "fix build with PHP 8.6.0alpha2"
by Remi Collet (open as of 2026-11-19). Drop once it is merged and released.

